# The phone number written into private/resume.pdf — the copy attached to an
# application by hand. Read only by scripts/build-resume.mjs, which injects
# it into the loaded page in the browser; no route and no server component
# reads it, so setting it in a deployment environment does nothing.
#
# Never into public/resume.pdf or onto /resume: a number on anything
# published is scraped into permanent spam volume.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. .env.local is gitignored, so
# the value stays off GitHub and out of the history; without it,
# `npm run resume` still writes the public PDF and says it skipped the
# private one.
RESUME_PHONE=
